\taxon{Remark}
\title{How we formulate window sampling and packing}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{pretraining}

\p{\citek{kaplan2020scaling}, Section 2.2, uses fixed-length sequence batches.}

\p{\citek{phuong2022formal}, Section 7, gives the causal language-model
objective.}

\p{We formulate the sampler, segment identifiers, document mask, and prediction
mask so the boundary choices omitted by those high-level accounts remain
explicit.}

\p{These objects describe one admissible data interface. A concrete training
run must replace them with its offset, padding, joining, masking, and packing
rules.}
